# Do not maintain a showcase catalog in nqui

**Never** add or restore a Vite component catalog, recipes app, or `src/pages/` demo surfaces in this repository.

| Need | Where |
|------|--------|
| Live `/catalog`, recipes, patterns | Sibling **nqui-showcase** → `src/components/showcase/` |
| Pre-publish visual QA | `cd ../nqui-showcase && pnpm nqui:local && pnpm dev` |
| Library components | `src/components/`, `src/entries/` |

`npm run dev` only prints this pointer. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [CLAUDE.md](../../CLAUDE.md).
